    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a31225e111efa75942bf4de7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三后冠路线的最终战、\n决定世代代表的最后一战，\n在此拉开序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc38abd13611fab44fa84a882f9f0bb4c06144fd7350f61af90553d79a3e684",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
