      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd222d3edb161ad9846aef08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄从东商变革那里获得勇气，\n拿下了“天皇赏（秋）”的胜利，\n并表示接下来要称霸“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db90a51d0d6185be82ddc95847ff5651bc11153c324310066e48a3d9d3cfbd45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b86d43db647c7362f515fbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与此同时，\n东商变革要求训练员挑选一场比赛，\n让她和三冠路线的选手们一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014a7ee4b1c0199923541bd5371f23837d7786bcdd48e99df878ec114dbd4199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb40c62ea05e1d82ed71cb8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该选择哪场比赛作为关键舞台，\n对全世界施展赛跑魔法。\n就看她在今天的“伊丽莎白女王杯”的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61bc82e0b5f8b09564d8959302d5c29d2c1c4e52f9e8b8e730a6049e93ce6e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ba9a697a6d9b759b86aefc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向伊丽莎白女王杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a73ddfd6c02b8c1013fc96401c76621b531fadd817b597905ef99d5c5ea9a5",
