    {
      "uid": "zhcn:529e96ec7119f8a6d7bd87d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在过去的比赛纪录中，\n很少出现三后冠路线的赛马娘\n在“安田纪念”获胜的状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "986e6067345f48fc78e5b4df4fb9d5831375435bd8f431453a94864261c3b1e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
