    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f76282ef056aaad2cbce89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且之后紧接着就是“宝冢纪念”。\n如果是东商变革……！\n她在观众的期待下，前往挑战比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "226f02506c78a6324ea7f3626647633890229a52ed4a89a27520979a73867e9b",
