      "source_text": "但是训练员保证她不会有问题。\n东商变革听见后不仅没有迟到，\n还在演唱会上做出了完美的表演。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c9d338eea506e8192a40a6cd13f76490a03a2f8b6e9b33b985ddffe61a4df8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bf172a8d43dfb3c9418e4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阪神JF结束后・柱子后方",
      "source_fingerprint": "10475289b0f0ba7c65f8325e7997596314278e7be86ab058519a5528ccb911f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b22141e7f464c1a9221fd81b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革在“樱花赏”全力以赴，\n赛况也确实非常热烈，但大家的焦点\n还是一样集中在经典三冠的选手身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bd0ee2782baea05b3cf5953b915ed8836414ba54a65a235c3b1b4dd73c495f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34cef47b2f184c309083f80f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，三后冠路线的赛马娘聚在一起接受采访，\n东商变革宣告自己将会改变无聊的常识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca2b4cb5bf890620bc032136b680f16645b94ff213ff6cdfd913f3080185c4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:539afe2fd5b35c0d813a6574",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说首先是跑完三后冠。\n等升上古马级后，要战胜三冠路线的选手，\n改变历史。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0e7404df7056da8103a5659af3932688ca4b95dc9a5afe272342ec3acd1baf0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434c4af3f3856f7ae8d510b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一个目标是三后冠路线的第二战，“橡树大赛”。\n这位小魔女将面临决定橡木女王的炽热对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d16346aba45504d9e08346c1281133074acac56e69a31e4f41d8e08f2abb65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4de50fcb562404a802c8cd3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花赏结束后・感觉不太对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca8d32223e67231f8f54892f0c4a8c9218ba6275f5e67b1afc3dd82b4863214",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08769b41dba435c6de29b3fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起跑完火热的比赛后，\n参赛者们也赞同东商变革的想法。\n她们表示三后冠一样是至高无上的荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fb70b554a15ee474fe6e0cea00000855c1401860fa63260fc47e59dadf4806",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7975756de450c7e3284b14dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不只如此，\n荒漠英雄也说她从今天的比赛中获得了勇气，\n简直“就像魔法一样”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df32918cb38be9e72b0cf56862cb2dd550398727cc3d395703d5b46b269aef3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4a0ea0ba800322dd4cf4395",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革很高兴自己成功对她施展魔法，\n并开始为下一个目标“秋华赏”做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a4f82df4c9e19fc33bcedb638ff079bac363261bb11c4deed60cf2dba52de77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ea9afbfcd0979d9367d580",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "橡树大赛结束后・魔法的轮廓",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe0b6a084e3eea651629cef31465ecd8ad2ee446674cf70a1f0e16544941259b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044424.json",
