    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c289c39bfc8e268f9bd9f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光是成为今年的三后冠路线代表还不够。\n必须变得更特别才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e970e4a9b3e68fd422ba007fce5a74d0c67686a550baed870c02ec4deae53a7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
