    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f64de6a195dd4ec13843d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她决定接下来要参加“伊丽莎白女王杯”，\n和经历过三后冠路线的古马级选手们对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c97203ef3fb2edeae239c4d59ce5fbb99012f9378036c2894fc4f73f60c0cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
